.TH ZORG 1 2026-10-05 "zorg 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zorg \- a fast, lightweight, CLI-only Zcash wallet
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zorg
.RI [ GLOBAL\ FLAGS ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zorg
is a command-line Zcash wallet. It manages accounts, keeps a local
copy of the shielded blockchain state in a SQLite database, and builds
and broadcasts shielded transfers natively from the terminal. The
mnemonic is stored in the macOS Keychain; wallet state lives in a
SQLite database (see
.BR FILES ).
.PP
Zorg is a moment, not a presence: every command runs, prints, and
exits. Nothing is left running.
.SH GLOBAL FLAGS
Recognized before or after the command:
.TP
.BI \-\-network " main|test"
Target network. Defaults to mainnet.
.TP
.BI \-\-db " path"
Path to the wallet database. Defaults to
.IR ~/Library/Application\ Support/zorg/wallet.db .
.TP
.BI \-\-lwd " url"
lightwalletd endpoint override. Well-known public endpoints are the
default; use only if you need a specific one.
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.B \-V\fR, \fB\-\-version
Print version and exit.
.PP
Environment equivalents:
.B ZORG_NETWORK\fR,
.B ZORG_WALLET_DB\fR,
.B ZORG_LIGHTWALLETD_URL\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI zorg\ create " [\-\-name\ n] [\-\-birthday\ height]"
Create a new wallet and print its mnemonic. The name defaults to
"Account 1". The wallet birthday defaults to the current chain tip
(resolved via the lightwalletd endpoint); pass an explicit height to
scan from earlier.
.TP
.BI zorg\ import " mnemonic [\-\-passphrase\ p] [\-\-name\ n]"
Import an existing wallet from its mnemonic (optionally passphrase-
protected) and reconstruct its accounts.
.TP
.B zorg\ accounts
List all accounts: uuid, name, and unified address.
.TP
.BI zorg\ balance " [\-\-account\ uuid]"
Print spendable, pending, and locked balances for the account
(the first account, if none given).
.TP
.BI zorg\ address " [\-\-account\ uuid]"
Print the account's unified receiving address.
.TP
.B zorg\ sync
Scan the blockchain and bring the wallet database up to the chain tip.
.TP
.B zorg\ status
Print scan progress against the chain tip (height, percentage,
complete flag).
.TP
.BI zorg\ send " to\ zec [\-\-memo\ text]"
Propose, authorize, and broadcast a shielded transfer of
.I zec
to
.IR to .
Prints the fee before authorization and the broadcast txids after.
.TP
.BI zorg\ history " [\-\-account\ uuid] [\-\-limit\ n]"
Print recent transactions.
.TP
.BI zorg\ validate " address"
Check whether
.I address
is a valid Zcash address.
.TP
.BI zorg\ delete " uuid"
Delete an account from the wallet database.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/Library/Application Support/zorg/wallet.db
Default wallet database (override with
.B \-\-db
or
.BR ZORG_WALLET_DB ).
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, nonzero on error. Errors are printed to stderr.
